join detective right
detective: What can you tell me about the Count’s niece?
join guard left
guard: I can’t say I know her well, but she’s a bit overly proper, if you ask me.
guard: At least she’s polite. I’ve met a lot of really nasty guests in my years as a guard.
guard: Honestly, I spend more time dealing with them than any outside threats.
guard: But there was something strange about her face when we both found the body.
